    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smuggler City Simulator</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >offers players a simulation full of trade, smuggling, and strategy! Build, expand, and customize your own office from scratch. Grow your business by buying and selling phones, while obtaining your products through illegal means and using stealth mechanics to pass through customs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk and Middle Eastern Themes</strong>: Explore a unique atmosphere as you navigate between neon-lit cities and scorching deserts. Each map offers different tactics and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/51035d6642c057ccc09a3184762d4c9a.poster.avif?t=1750893302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/51035d6642c057ccc09a3184762d4c9a.webm?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/51035d6642c057ccc09a3184762d4c9a.mp4?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office Management</strong>: Paint your walls, decorate your office with various materials, and invest in modern equipment to grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/46fd335f2487aec6eac752c3399e6369.poster.avif?t=1750893302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/46fd335f2487aec6eac752c3399e6369.webm?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/46fd335f2487aec6eac752c3399e6369.mp4?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles and Stealth Mechanics</strong>: Use vehicles like donkeys or transporters to move your goods and devise clever plans to avoid getting caught at customs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/79c6c184d7688df06a68c3c56eda6647.poster.avif?t=1750893302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/79c6c184d7688df06a68c3c56eda6647.webm?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/79c6c184d7688df06a68c3c56eda6647.mp4?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smuggling and Trading</strong>: Obtain your products through secret means and make a profit, but stay cautious \u2013 the law is watching!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/cdf9b4bbddb8beb544eb5b9863c77de5.poster.avif?t=1750893302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/cdf9b4bbddb8beb544eb5b9863c77de5.webm?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/cdf9b4bbddb8beb544eb5b9863c77de5.mp4?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into this thrilling simulation world and reach the pinnacle of trade and strategy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smuggler City Simulator</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >offers players a simulation full of trade, smuggling, and strategy! Build, expand, and customize your own office from scratch. Grow your business by buying and selling phones, while obtaining your products through illegal means and using stealth mechanics to pass through customs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk and Middle Eastern Themes</strong>: Explore a unique atmosphere as you navigate between neon-lit cities and scorching deserts. Each map offers different tactics and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/51035d6642c057ccc09a3184762d4c9a.poster.avif?t=1750893302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/51035d6642c057ccc09a3184762d4c9a.webm?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/51035d6642c057ccc09a3184762d4c9a.mp4?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office Management</strong>: Paint your walls, decorate your office with various materials, and invest in modern equipment to grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/46fd335f2487aec6eac752c3399e6369.poster.avif?t=1750893302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/46fd335f2487aec6eac752c3399e6369.webm?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/46fd335f2487aec6eac752c3399e6369.mp4?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles and Stealth Mechanics</strong>: Use vehicles like donkeys or transporters to move your goods and devise clever plans to avoid getting caught at customs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/79c6c184d7688df06a68c3c56eda6647.poster.avif?t=1750893302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/79c6c184d7688df06a68c3c56eda6647.webm?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/79c6c184d7688df06a68c3c56eda6647.mp4?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smuggling and Trading</strong>: Obtain your products through secret means and make a profit, but stay cautious \u2013 the law is watching!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/cdf9b4bbddb8beb544eb5b9863c77de5.poster.avif?t=1750893302\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/cdf9b4bbddb8beb544eb5b9863c77de5.webm?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481660/extras/cdf9b4bbddb8beb544eb5b9863c77de5.mp4?t=1750893302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into this thrilling simulation world and reach the pinnacle of trade and strategy!</p>",
